keynote today or yesterday.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.850
We've been working
with NetApp for a while

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:21.060
to build Cloud Volumes for GCP,
which we'll talk about today.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.940
Essentially, the vision is to
build a high performance file

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.390
storage offering, a fully
managed service that's

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.390
integrated with
GCP, something that

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:33.310
