Cloud user, a GCP user,

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.740
and you're used to our UI,
or you're used to our billing

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:14.070
or working with Google
support, none of that changes

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.735
when you use Cloud
Volumes for GCP.

00:01:16.735 --> 00:01:18.360
So essentially, the
idea is to give you

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.090
a completely seamless
experience if you're

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:23.370
using Cloud Volumes with
Google Cloud platform,

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.520
and you keep using the
tools that you're used

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.310
to when you use Google Cloud.

