00:15:39.429 --> 00:15:40.720
these clients within a subnet--

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:43.100
10 clients, 50 clients,
whatever it is--

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:45.150
all have either read-only
or read-write access.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:48.227
This is how security for
the volume is managed.

