00:37:00.970 --> 00:37:03.440
There may be a NetApp
person there to help solve,

00:37:03.440 --> 00:37:05.860
but Google and the
customer are where

00:37:05.860 --> 00:37:07.360
the support endpoints are.

00:37:07.360 --> 00:37:09.359
JONSI STEFANSSON: Yeah,
that's one of the things

