have a single support contact,

00:37:14.920 --> 00:37:17.930
you have a single contact for
everything, and that's Google.

00:37:17.930 --> 00:37:19.060
So it should be--

00:37:19.060 --> 00:37:21.010
we wanted to have
it as integrated

00:37:21.010 --> 00:37:22.270
in all areas as possible.

00:37:22.270 --> 00:37:26.770
So it's been really good.

00:37:26.770 --> 00:37:28.660
And it's been a
