any time you want.

00:38:40.790 --> 00:38:43.790
JONSI STEFANSSON: It is
actually like a soft quota.

00:38:43.790 --> 00:38:45.041
So it's not like a hard limit.

00:38:45.041 --> 00:38:47.498
You can actually go above it,
and we'll actually pick it up

00:38:47.498 --> 00:38:48.140
in the billing.

00:38:48.140 --> 00:38:50.480
So you can actually,
if in some weird cases

00:38:50.480 --> 00:38:54.740
you don't want the performance,
and you allocated a terabyte,

00:38:54.740 --> 00:38:58.070
